## 📁 Project Structure

```
src/
├── components/
│   ├── Dashboard.tsx        # Main app shell
│   ├── EmotionDetector.tsx  # Webcam + face-api emotion detection
│   ├── SpotifyPlayer.tsx    # Spotify integration & playback
│   ├── MusicPlayer.tsx      # Audio player with visualizer
│   ├── RoomPanel.tsx        # Create / join sync rooms
│   ├── ChatPanel.tsx        # Real-time room chat
│   ├── FriendsPanel.tsx     # Friends & their current tracks
│   ├── Whiteboard.tsx       # Collaborative drawing canvas
│   └── ui/                  # shadcn/ui component library
├── lib/
│   ├── auth.tsx             # Auth context (Firebase + Supabase)
│   ├── music.ts             # Emotion → music mapping
│   ├── room.ts              # Room state & sync logic
│   ├── spotify.ts           # Spotify API helpers
│   └── saavn.ts             # JioSaavn API helpers
└── routes/
    ├── index.tsx            # Dashboard route
    ├── login.tsx            # Auth page
    └── insights.tsx         # Mood analytics
```

